margin":0,"fontStyle":"italic"},"children":"A Finance Manager is pulling data from three or four different systems every month — the accounting package, the CRM, maybe an operations spreadsheet — copying it into a master Excel file, cleaning it up, rebuilding the charts, and sending a report to the MD. It takes two days. The MD then asks a question the report does not answer, and the whole process starts again."}]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","color":"var(--ink-2)","lineHeight":"1.85","marginBottom":"24px"},"children":"This is not an Excel problem. It is a process problem. The fix is not necessarily Power BI — it might be automating the Excel process so the data pulls and cleans itself automatically. Or it might be a Power BI dashboard that connects directly to the source systems. Or both."}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","color":"var(--ink-2)","lineHeight":"1.85","marginBottom":"48px"},"children":"The right answer depends on what your team actually needs, what systems you are working with, and how many people need access to the output. There is no universal answer — but there is a right answer for your specific situation."}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"borderRadius":"var(--radius-lg)","overflow":"hidden","marginBottom":"48px","border":"1px solid var(--border)"},"children":["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8e8b4b6d7e3?w=780&q=80","alt":"Team working with data and analytics tools","style":{"width":"100%","height":"280px","objectFit":"cover","display":"block"}}]}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem)","marginBottom":"20px","letterSpacing":"-0.02em"},"children":"5 signs you are ready for Power BI"}],[["$","div","0",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"Your reports take more than a day to produce"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"If someone is spending significant time every week or month rebuilding a report that answers the same questions, that time is being wasted. Power BI can automate the build entirely."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"More than two people need the same data"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"Once you are emailing Excel files around, you have a version control problem. Someone is always working off last week's numbers. Power BI gives everyone the same live view."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"Leadership keeps asking questions your report does not answer"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"A static Excel report can only show what was built into it. A Power BI dashboard lets the MD filter by region, product, or time period without asking someone to rebuild the report."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"Your data lives in multiple systems"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"If you are copying data from Xero, Salesforce, or an ops system into Excel manually, Power BI can connect to all of those sources directly and pull them together automatically."}]]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"You have had a data error cause a real problem"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"Manual copying and formula-heavy spreadsheets are prone to human error. When a mistake in a report affects a business decision, that is the moment to automate the process."}]]}]]}]],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem)","marginBottom":"20px","letterSpacing":"-0.02em","marginTop":"16px"},"children":"5 signs Excel is still the right tool"}],[["$","div","0",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"You are building financial models"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"Budgets, forecasts, three-way financial models — Excel is still the best tool for this. The cell-level control and formula logic in Excel cannot be replicated in Power BI."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"You need to enter and edit data directly"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"Power BI is read-only. If the workflow involves people typing data into the tool, Excel is the only option."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"var(--serif)","fontSize":"32px","color":"rgba(193,125,46,0.3)","flexShrink":0,"lineHeight":"1","marginTop":"4px"},"children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"17px","marginBottom":"10px","color":"var(--ink)"},"children":"Only one or two people use the output"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"15px","color":"var(--ink-3)","lineHeight":"1.75","margin":0},"children":"If a single analyst produces a report for one person, the overhead of building a Power BI solution probably outweighs the benefit. Automate the Excel process instead."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":"24px","marginBottom":"36px","alignItems":"flex-start"},"children":[["$"